			"notes": "A new feature, and a bugfix!\n\nThe original `TRAMPLE_CROPS` capability has now been split into `TRAMPLE_CROPS` and `TRAMPLE_FARMLAND` (see #3).\nFor more details, check the newly updated [README](README.md).\n\nAdditionally, previous versions were incorrectly overwriting calculated configurations (e.g. `BREAK_DOORS`) whenever the server was restarted, setting them back to their defaults. This issue has now been resolved (see #4)."
